<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan forex reserves slip to $1.734 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan forex reserves slip to $1.734 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's foreign exchange reserves fell to $1.734 billion on Thursday from $1.743 billion on May 31, compared to $2.068 billion a year ago, the State (central) Bank of Pakistan said.</p>
<p>    (bln dollars)		  June 12    May 31    June 6, 1996</p>
<p>TOTAL 1.734 1.743 2.068 Forex in Pakistan 0.802 0.516 0.918 Forex outside Pakistan 0.258 0.554 0.454 Gold coins and bullion 0.671 0.671 0.693 Special Drawing Rights 0.001 0.001 0.001</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
